{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Accepting a Job Offer"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The First Conditional "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use the first conditional to talk about possible actions and situations in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are two parts to the sentence.<br/><br/>  One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>. <br/><br/>Form:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span>* + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present tense</span>  + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">will/won't</span><br/>You use a comma after the condition in this form.<br/><br/>  *You can use other words instead of <span class=\"italic\">if</span>, you can use <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> or <span class=\"italic\">when</span>. These are words we use with future time clauses.<br/><br/>  You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Before you come to the front desk,</span><br/><br/>  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">After your interview,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you'll have to call.</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">you will want to get your ID card!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You'll need to get your access card</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">You may send them an e-mail</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">when you come!</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">if you have any questions.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use these expressions to express an opinion:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I think \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">In my opinion \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I believe that ...</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">As far as I'm concerned \u2026</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think coming in the morning is easy. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "In my opinion, the afternoons are busy. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "As far as we're concerned, you are a great fit for our team."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way in which a person matches with something else "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We believe that you will be a great fit to our magazine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work and jobs. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "publication"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a magazine, paper, etc., that is printed and made available to the public "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You will be a part of our publication's staff. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "freelancer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works independently for a company  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was hired as a freelancer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to join"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to become a member "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would love to join your team."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to transfer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to connect someone who has called you to someone else's phone  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He transferred me over to the front desk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "receptionist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who talks to people arriving at an office and answers the phone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The receptionist booked me in for a session."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meet and greet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an event where a new employee goes and meets other people who work in the office "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I called the receptionist to book in my meet and greet with the company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (10-12 lines) between a manager and a new employee."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pretend you are the manager. You are going to call the new employee and offer them a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your opinion with them. Use the first conditional."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about jobs and work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share an opinion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about possible actions in the future. "}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Hello, Sally? This is Mr. Gold. I'm calling from Cambridge Life about your interview.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah, Mr. Gold. How are you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: I'm well, thanks. We believe that you will be a great fit to our publication. If this position is still of interest to you, you will join our team as a freelancer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! I would love to.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Fantastic. You will need to send an e-mail to HR so that they can get you all set up and  attend a meet and greet. I'll transfer you over to the receptionist.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK. Thank you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Before I do that, I'll need to know your availability.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Anytime works for me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: OK. Please hold for a moment.", "id": 2, "time": "23000", 